<title>UK: Dow Chemical sets $200 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dow Chemical sets $200 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers DKBI and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DOW CHEMICAL CO</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    15.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.318   PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.743    SPREAD	+31 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
